{"title":"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 49","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Stars_and_Bars)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Stars and Bars)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the expansion of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/8/d58cd9608de189ee4d57059829c767b53dec9f81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a + b)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" /> there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/5/ac5429dc4aa7ba1f3b20be4599a34c4220cc79db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> dissimilar terms. The number of dissimilar terms in the expansion of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/2/222b6d1c0edad7d448c73a573af31bd9e025eaff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a + b + c)^{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"19\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/5/36556263be09800110a96bddbe5002b8b3d6fd46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 11\\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ 33\\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ 55\\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ 66\\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ 132$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"403\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Expand the binomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/a/bfa704f38e2c1cd373abaaa4563e8e4952a6eaba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$((a+b)+c)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"106\" height=\"18\" /> with the binomial theorem. We have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/2/e725bca22403df696716c07255dd306e9dcd4333.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum\\limits_{k=0}^{10} \\binom{10}{k} (a+b)^k c^{10-k}\\]\" width=\"175\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>So for each iteration of the summation operator, we add k+1 dissimilar terms. Therefore our answer is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/c/bdc92d46f69d4d77597bf6b65ef54c6d80639b20.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum\\limits_{k=0}^{10} k+1 = \\frac{11(1+11)}{2} = 66 \\to \\boxed{\\textbf{D}}\\]\" width=\"276\" height=\"50\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Stars_and_Bars.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Stars_and_Bars)\">Solution 2 (Stars and Bars)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Stars and Bars)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each term in the expansion of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/2/ba29cbd0f8a887e3cfc855be802b5a7b56e31f1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b+c)^{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"100\" height=\"21\" /> will have the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/8/2289d6199ee13e2fbc264c55c874abf866eca9e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^i \\times b^j \\times c^k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"92\" height=\"19\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/b/31b096d23e7b9a977f3c52479ded7a352a9de2c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le i, j, k\\le 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/2/6022baaa9db816905a7f2edaf6b377adee7f2baa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"111\" height=\"14\" />. So, we need to find the number of triplets of nonnegative integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/0/d80414f2f94f70731e91b6e12c4e6934c8fa65de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b, c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/2/6022baaa9db816905a7f2edaf6b377adee7f2baa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"111\" height=\"14\" />. Using Stars and Bars, this value is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/f/caf2a12c403a2c036c48c72bf98bd43f9dc6aec7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{12}{2}=66$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"88\" height=\"53\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME\" title=\"1958 AHSME\">1958 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1958 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1958\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_48\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 48\">Problem 48</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_50\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 50\">Problem 50</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1958 AHSME